#: crates/tagjoe-gui/src/settings.rs:329
msgid "Every online source is off until you switch it on. tagjoe then sends only what the source needs (listed under each switch) and, as with any network access, your IP address. Without any source tagjoe works from tags and folder names only; for identification, covers and audiobook data switch on at least MusicBrainz (music) or AudiobookDB/Audnexus (audiobooks). Responses are cached locally."
